{"id":"b201853606d6de9c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logically-equivalent.md","title":"Logically Equivalent","display":"df-logically-equivalent — Logically Equivalent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logically-equivalent","aliases":["92-df-logically-equivalent"],"display":"df-logically-equivalent — Logically Equivalent","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logically-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logically-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logically-equivalent — Logically Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-logically-equivalent-—-Logically-Equivalent-$\\equiv$\">df-logically-equivalent — Logically Equivalent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\">\\(\\equiv\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formulas)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eqv}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Eqv}_G\\)</span> (definition-target relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\varphi,\\psi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\\bigl((\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\varphi,\\psi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\\bigl((\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\equiv \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\equiv \\psi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>逻辑等价</li>\n<li>在所有结构和赋值中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>同时真或假</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi \\equiv \\neg(\\neg\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\psi)\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi \\equiv \\neg(\\neg\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\psi)\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi \\equiv \\neg\\exists x\\;\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi \\equiv \\neg\\exists x\\;\\neg\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>逻辑等价在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言结构中保持真值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\)</span> 一般只保证二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的模型中等价；只有纯逻辑可证或另有全结构可靠性时，才能推出这里定义的逻辑等价</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-logically-equivalent-—-Logically-Equivalent-$\\equiv$","text":"df-logically-equivalent — Logically Equivalent $\\equiv$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\equiv","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eqv}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash \\mathrm{Eqv}_G(\\varphi,\\psi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\\bigl((\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi \\equiv \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\land \\psi \\equiv \\neg(\\neg\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\varphi \\equiv \\neg\\exists x\\;\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1433,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eqv}_G$ (logical-equivalence relation, see [[92-df-logically-equivalent]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logically-equivalent]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92